										<Access>rw</Access>
										<Description>Lower value for flow colour change.  Parameter only active after selection of a freely definable colour window in the coL.F parameter: [r-cF] or [G-cF]. The setting range corresponds to the measuring range and its maximum limit is [cFH.F]</Description>
